# --- Data ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Downloaded slide images: ~2 MB each and the full CRIC collection is 400
# of them (~800 MB). Regenerate with: python src/download_data.py
data/raw/*.png
data/raw/*.jpg
data/raw/*.jpeg
data/raw/*.tif
data/raw/*.tiff

# Derived outputs: regenerate with features.py / triage.py
data/processed/*.csv
output/*
!output/.gitkeep

# Tracked on purpose (small, and they are the provenance + ground truth):
#   data/raw/metadata.csv        - article ID -> filename mapping
#   data/raw/classifications.csv - Bethesda labels + nucleus coordinates
#   data/raw/README.md           - dataset field documentation
